    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn to type Korean Hangul \ud55c\uae00 under 2 hours!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/5c5487442fc79e2bdecda9c3e29d2461.poster.avif?t=1734151068\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/5c5487442fc79e2bdecda9c3e29d2461.apng?t=1734151068\" class=\"bb_img\" width=304 height=86 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning a language difficult, but this game isn't about learning to understand the language, hence it's not difficult at all\u00a0\u30fd(\u30c5)\u30ce\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's all about TYPING KOREAN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/b5eee431eccc18e1ef3b3b04c8c1ff81.poster.avif?t=1734151068\" width=174 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/b5eee431eccc18e1ef3b3b04c8c1ff81.webm?t=1734151068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Oeguk Princess\u00a0\uc678\uad6d\uacf5\uc8fc to type Korean Hangul to fly high and save her Prince\u00a0\uad6d\ubbfc\uc655\uc790\u00a0from the evil Drongon! Reach the moon, where they make Tteok together in tent \ud83d\udc97\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf40 Learn to type Korean letters with your keyboard or on-screen keyboard <br>\ud83e\udd86 Professor Duck to guide you through the basic of \u00a0Korean letters and words!<br>\ud83c\udf40 10+ chapters to master Korean words &amp; sentences, including numbers, colors, month, foods,\u00a0common verbs, sentences...many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf41<br>Mini-games to enhance your reflex with numbers, colors, handwriting... <br>\ud83c\udf41 Not just birdies, but also insects and mammals will attack you with the best of Korean!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/385168050c592e27055f4db06ca744cf.poster.avif?t=1734151068\" width=296 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/385168050c592e27055f4db06ca744cf.webm?t=1734151068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/385168050c592e27055f4db06ca744cf.mp4?t=1734151068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/06682c3023287cf18d9563148ac4fd86.poster.avif?t=1734151068\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320380/extras/06682c3023287cf18d9563148ac4fd86.apng?t=1734151068\" class=\"bb_img\" width=144 height=89 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Vit Corp.</strong></p>",
